# RELEASE-NOTES — Residua 0.1.1

English | [中文](RELEASE-NOTES.zh-CN)

Release 0.1.1 is the minimal self-bootstrap closure: verifiable-provenance
compilation. Given a source and an artifact, anyone can rebuild from the
committed wasm seed with a C compiler and no other toolchain, and check
byte for byte that the artifact comes from the source — trusting neither
the publisher nor a large binary toolchain.

